       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MODULAREXPONENT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BASE-VAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 4.
       01 EXP-VAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 13.
       01 MOD-VAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 497.
       01 RESULT-VAL PIC 9(8) VALUE 1.
       01 CUR-BASE PIC 9(8).
       01 CUR-EXP PIC 9(4).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE BASE-VAL TO CUR-BASE
           MOVE EXP-VAL TO CUR-EXP
           PERFORM UNTIL CUR-EXP = 0
               IF FUNCTION MOD(CUR-EXP, 2) = 1
                   COMPUTE RESULT-VAL =
                       FUNCTION MOD(RESULT-VAL * CUR-BASE, MOD-VAL)
               END-IF
               COMPUTE CUR-BASE = FUNCTION MOD(CUR-BASE * CUR-BASE, MOD-VAL)
               COMPUTE CUR-EXP = CUR-EXP / 2
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "RESULT: " RESULT-VAL
           STOP RUN.
